# Format and lint the staged files, then let the commit through.
#
# Only things that *change* the commit belong here: `prettier --write` rewrites
# a staged file and lint-staged restages it, so it has to run before the
# snapshot is taken. Validation that changes nothing -- the test suite -- runs
# in .husky/pre-push instead, where it gates what actually reaches main.
#
# The linters run locally at all because .github/workflows/deploy.yml is a
# single job: build, test, lint, then deploy. A lint failure there is a failed
# deploy of the live site, not a failed check on a pull request.
npx lint-staged
